Subject: [PATCH] wireless: require complete bounded J714s N1 host tunables

Add a follow-up to the existing public 0028 metadata patch. Keep other boards optional and refuse incomplete or out-of-window J714s host lists before Linux starts. Include the actual-helper host regression fixture and native integration boundary.

AI-assisted contribution; no human DCO sign-off asserted.
